vault.one_button = Press one button at a time.
vault.too_long = The key can have at most {0} presses.
vault.weak.short = Too short: use at least {0} presses.
vault.weak.pattern = Too simple: use at least 3 different buttons and avoid repeating patterns.
vault.mismatch = The two sequences differ. Try again.
